# Privacy statement

This statement covers {{ project_name }} at [{{ host }}]({{ site_url }}). {{ author_name }} runs it
and decides what happens to any data about you, which makes {{ author_name }} the data controller.
"We" on this page means {{ author_name }}.

## What {{ project_name }} keeps
{% if user_data == 'nothing' %}
Nothing. {{ project_name }} has no accounts, sets no cookies and stores nothing on your device.
{%- elif user_data == 'browser' %}
{{ project_name }} keeps your work in your browser's local storage, on your device, so it's still
there when you come back. It never leaves your device: we don't get it, and nor does anyone else.
Nothing is stored until you start working. To remove it, clear this site's data in your browser's
settings.

