## Cookies and storage
{% if user_data == 'nothing' %}
{{ project_name }} sets no cookies and stores nothing on your device, so it has no cookie banner.
{%- elif user_data == 'browser' %}
{{ project_name }} sets no cookies. It uses local storage only to keep your work, which is what you
asked it to do. Storage that only does what you asked for needs no consent, so there's no cookie
banner.
